commit f304a1814739af863289fd76b6c351b533f2455a
Author: Nxeon <haxkodi@gmail.com>
Date:   Fri Sep 25 12:12:42 2026 +0000

    Fix Grandfathered tag firing on nearly every server, not just true holdovers

    grandfatheredRenewalCents is set on EVERY order/resize as routine
    "freeze the rate you were sold at" behavior, so a bare `!= null` check
    tagged brand-new customers on today's live pricing the same as someone
    actually held at an old, no-longer-offered rate. Now only tags when the
    locked rate diverges from the live plan/game-plan price, mirroring the
    comparison already used on the single-server admin page.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

